        "original_id": "c15a10dc-82ce-5372-83a4-4fed574a7969",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Laura Dern\n- Events: 66th Academy Awards, Academy Awards for Technical Achievement\n- Places: The Beverly Hilton, Beverly Hills, California\n- Works: Rambling Rose, Wild\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Actress, Academy Award for Best Supporting Actress\n\nFacts:\n- On February 26, nearly a month before the 66th Academy Awards, the Academy Awards for Technical Achievement were presented at The Beverly Hilton in Beverly Hills, California.\n- Laura Dern hosted the February 26 ceremony for the Academy Awards for Technical Achievement.\n- Laura Dern was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Actress for her performance in the 1991 film Rambling Rose.\n- Laura Dern was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actress for her performance in the 2014 film Wild.",
